ve", "Seance"], "long_description": "The Presence is a proof-of-concept demonstration showing how interactive elements can make 360\u00b0 films more immersive. The story follows four characters through a s\u00e9ance gone wrong. This demo contains two new approaches to VR storytelling: \"active\" and \"reactive.\" In both versions, the viewer influences how the story unfolds. In the \"active\" version the viewer is able to jump between multiple perspectives at will; while in the \"reactive\" version the viewer's gaze motivates the next shot, editing the film organically.\n\n          Additional storage required:  ~1.5GB\n          Runtime:  ~6 minutes\n\nThe Presence contains strong language and violence and is recommended for a mature audience only.\n\nThe Presence works with the Gear VR touchpad or most Bluetooth controllers. For viewers who have a SubPac, The Presence utilizes SubPac\u2019s tactile audio technology for a more immersive experience.", "short_description": "The Presence is a proof-of-concept demo showing how interactive elements can improve 360\u00b0 films. The story follows four characters through a s\u00e9ance gone wrong. This demo contains two new approaches to VR storytelling: \"active\" and \"reactive.\" In the active version the viewer is able to jump between multiple perspectives at will; while in the reactive version the viewer's gaze motivates the next shot.\n         Additional storage required:  ~1.5GB\n         Runtime:  ~6 minutes"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://joshgladstone.com/tos_privacy.htm", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://joshgladstone.com/tos_privacy.htm", "publisher_name": "Pseudoscience Pictures", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://joshgladstone.com/", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["HORROR", "MOVIE", "